    "created_at": "2015-11-09T12:29:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-09T12:30:03Z",
    "body": "I think I might want to add some steps in [Navigate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#navigate) for the selection of the registration for local urls.\n\nAlso, I noticed that I cannot set the client's active worker to the registration's active worker in [Handle Fetch](https://slightlyoff.github.io/ServiceWorker/spec/service_worker/#on-fetch-request-algorithm) step 12.5 as the target browsing context's Window object has not been created by that time. So setting an active worker to a [window client](https://slightlyoff.github.io/ServiceWorker/spec/service_worker/#dfn-window-client) should also be specified in the Navigate algorithm?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
