    "created_at": "2015-11-09T12:51:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-09T12:51:02Z",
    "body": "Yeah, `blob` and `data` URLs do go through Fetch (not sure how the latter should be handled, perhaps it should always be without service worker). `about:blank` doesn't always.\n\nYou probably want to hook the service worker stuff into when a document is created. And similarly at the place where a worker is created.\n",
